  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Apache-2.0 unified training framework covering weakly supervised, MIL, and self-supervised workflows in a single API. 361 stars, v3.0.2 October 2024. Fills a gap between low-level libraries (TIA Toolbox) and research codebases (CLAM) by providing a training-focused abstraction. Assess for teams wanting a framework-level API rather than assembling individual components.",
